        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You take on a second Lineage's nature, partially and with effort. Choose a Lineage other than your own; <strong>this choice is permanent</strong>.</p><p>You learn that Lineage's free cantrip kid&#333; &mdash; <strong>Sh&#333;</strong>, <strong>Bala</strong> or <strong>Heizen</strong> &mdash; and it costs you no Reiatsu Point, exactly as it would for someone born to it.</p><p>You also gain <strong>Don the Other Face</strong>.</p><hr /><p><em>Every one of the six directions has a name in the source material: a Soul Reaper wearing a Hollow's mask is a <strong>Visored</strong>; a Hollow taking Shinigami power is what an <strong>Arrancar</strong> already is; a Quincy carrying either has Ichigo's own bloodline behind it.</em></p>"
        },
